    }
  },
  "basis": {
    "rows": "One row per tier line and major version (#329, D05 working draft). A row without a major in its slug is the latest available major of its line; an older available major adds -<major>; an archived point adds -<major>-<minor>. A -base line is the vendor's untiered model (not a pretrained checkpoint). Families whose plain slug the open-weight seed in PR #298 reserves (gemma, nemotron, mistral-small, gpt-oss, llama) use a tier or major in the slug instead.",
    "lifecycle": "Status after the apply, availability source, check date and coding source for every row live in docs/refresh/model-lifecycle.json, not here.",
    "facts": "Every stated fact sits under facts with its own source_url. A fact the reviewed sources do not state is left out, never estimated.",
    "status": "Rows are inserted inactive. The seed upsert never changes status; the separate status step (--set-status) sets the lifecycle target.",
    "scope": "This file is a reviewed seed only. It carries no metrics."
  },
